ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260527/202605272324054688_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260527/202605272324054688_720.jpg"> </div><p>【欧协联决赛】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-28/6a1720638d67dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">🏆鹰衔桂冠！水晶宫夺欧协联冠军，队史首获欧战冠军&amp;近1年3冠</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260528/6a17244932618.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260528/6a17244932618.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260528/6a17244932618.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">2025-26赛季欧协联决赛落幕，水晶宫1-0击败巴列卡诺，历史性首夺欧战冠军。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-28/match1975351date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">水晶宫1-0巴列卡诺夺欧协联冠军 格拉斯纳带队2年3冠 马特塔制胜</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260528/zhanbao_image_1975351_1779914359_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260528/zhanbao_image_1975351_1779914359_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260528/zhanbao_image_1975351_1779914359_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">水晶宫1-0击败巴列卡诺，夺得欧协联冠军！格拉斯纳带队2年夺3冠！英超球队夺得本赛季第2座欧战奖杯！</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-28/6a174d0589dabnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">枪手看你了！维拉水晶宫先后夺冠 英超包揽欧战3冠只差枪手夺欧冠</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260528/202605280551313511.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260528/202605280551313511_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260528/202605280551313511_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">接下来所有目光将聚焦5月31日欧冠决赛，阿森纳将对阵巴黎，枪手若能夺冠将帮助英超实现包揽三大欧战冠军的终极成就。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-28/6a175e80665a6native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">半个联赛有欧战！水晶宫夺欧协获欧联资格，英超下赛季9队踢欧战</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.36" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260528/202605280514311364.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.36" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.36" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260528/202605280514311364_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260528/202605280514311364_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">加上水晶宫获得的欧联资格后，英超下赛季将有9个队伍出战欧战。</span></p><p>【转会新闻】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-28/6a17359b1fd88native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">Here We Go！罗马诺：巴萨签下戈登，7000万欧+浮动总价超8000万</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260528/202605280220262948_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260528/202605280220262948_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260528/202605280220262948_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">名记罗马诺以标志性的“here we go”宣布，巴萨签下戈登，转会费7000万欧+浮动，总价超8000万欧！</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-28/6a173c9732072native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">Here We Go！罗马诺：热刺签利物浦边卫罗伯逊，尤文试图截胡未果</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260528/202605280249181665.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260528/202605280249181665_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260528/202605280249181665_720.jpg"> </div><p>名记罗马诺以标志性的“here we go”宣布，热刺签下利物浦边卫罗伯逊，双方已经达成口头协议，尤文尝试截胡未果。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-27/6a1710f862a7cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">TA：巴萨8000万欧+奖金报价戈登，拜仁同样有意但不愿付8000万欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.37" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_230828/64ecc106f0e7d.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.37" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.37" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_230828/64ecc106f0e7d.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_230828/64ecc106f0e7d.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">The Athletic消息，巴萨已向纽卡正式报价8000万欧元，外加浮动条款，求购边锋安东尼·戈登。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-28/6a17238fb8fb9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">TA：若巴萨签下戈登将不会激活拉什福德买断条款，有可能再次租借</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.43" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260405/69d184e2832a3.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.43" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.43" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260405/69d184e2832a3.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260405/69d184e2832a3.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">TA消息，拉什福德和曼联都希望他能在租借期间永久转会巴塞罗那，但如果戈登的转会最终完成，情况将会变得复杂。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-27/6a170abf60bd9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">英媒：恩佐想离队切尔西倾向留住他，想签他至少支付1.2亿英镑</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260512/6a02f8a4590ec.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260512/6a02f8a4590ec.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260512/6a02f8a4590ec.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rg